Imagine thirty parallel worlds, each living through the same hundred years of

2
00:00:04,538 --> 00:00:07,856
an economy. They share the rules, but not the luck. We are

3
00:00:07,956 --> 00:00:11,334
allowed to watch exactly one of them, the red one, and from

4
00:00:11,434 --> 00:00:13,927
