21
00:01:24,466 --> 00:01:28,629
The one life fills the outline of the many worlds. That is

22
00:01:28,729 --> 00:01:34,877
ergodicity: because memory fades, a single history eventually visits every region the

23
00:01:34,977 --> 00:01:40,096
