31
00:02:13,743 --> 00:02:16,747
not ergodic: the memory of the coin never fades.

32
00:02:17,833 --> 00:02:22,633
So two conditions let one history speak for all. Stationarity:

33
00:02:22,733 --> 00:02:27,297
every date obeys the same law. Ergodicity: memory fades, so

34
00:02:27,397 --> 00:02:31,644
